pip install <lib>
pip install --upgrade<lib>
pip uninstall <lib>

the above commands can be executed in any path in cmd

- Python
- Pycharm IDE
- Robotframework in File --> Settings --> Project --> Python Interpretor, if I install by pip it will not be considered in project, since project uses the virtual env.
- Robotframework-selenium library
- Intellibot for showing suggestions & different different colours in code & it also offers some other features.

Note : just selenium library is required to work with python in robotframework, else not required.

Libraries
===========]
Data driven testing
-------------------
- robotframework-datadriver imported as DataDriver library for data driven testing
- plugin : CSV Editor to work with csv files

Parallel Execution
----------------
robotframework-pabot for parallel tests execution.
After run:
- Total Testing Time : 1st test execution time + 2nd + 3rd ...
- Elasped time : parallel execution time
